        <p class="subhead">Hussnain Ahmad builds AI automation for dental clinics that want a calmer front desk and a fuller schedule.</p>
        <p class="muted">We focus on the admin that fills every day at reception: answering booking requests, confirming appointments, chasing recalls and asking for reviews. We would rather build one workflow your team trusts for years than ten experiments that need babysitting. If a simple fix beats an AI model, we will tell you.</p>
